%% Public website and entry into the dashboards.
flowchart TD
    Home[/fr or /ar home/] --> Cat[Category directory\nfilters in the URL]
    Home --> About[About platform / services]
    Home --> Contact[Contact form -> SupportRequest]
    Cat --> Profile[Category profile\nservices, portfolio, hours, booking panel]
    Profile --> Slot{Signed in\nverified client?}
    Slot -- no --> SignIn[Sign in / sign up\nchoice kept in the URL] --> Profile
    Slot -- yes --> Request[Request sent\nreference WC-XXXXXX]
    Request --> ClientDash[/dashboard/client/appointments/]
    SignIn --> Area{Role}
    Area -- CLIENT --> ClientDash
    Area -- PROVIDER --> ProDash[/dashboard/provider/]
    Area -- SUPPORT, ADMIN, SUPER_ADMIN --> AdminDash[/dashboard/admin/]
